WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350
If your team does the same task every single

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.430
day, I built the system that works for you.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.790
I'm Ian Vincent Rebuta from Bohol Philippines,

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.550
working on your hours, US,

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.030
UK and Australia.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:17.670
I spent six years in quality assurance for US companies,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.570
including leading 23 QAs across three countries.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.270
And that is where I learned how to spot

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.250
the work that repeats and where it breaks.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:32.310
At Nooro, I rebuilt the AI knowledge base behind

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.070
our AI call audits.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.650
So the AI stopped giving wrong answers.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:41.610
And the customer experience team held 97% satisfaction score.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:47.330
I built an AI concierge in GoHighLevel

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:50.410
so it works even if you sleep,

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.370
which makes the churn rate narrow down to nearly 0%.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:03.110
Follow-ups, reports, data entry and even social media postings,

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.990
those are the automated tasks that I can actually

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.250
do for your business.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:13.290
I map how your team does it today and

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.790
build it with Zapier,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.630
Google Apps Script and the AI tools that I currently use.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:23.150
So it runs without anyone babysitting on it.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.130
Tell me the task that you currently do every single day.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:28.310
Make sure that that will be the last

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:33.950
day that you'll be doing it by your hand.
